  "title": "Schnauzer Urn for Dog Ashes, Personalized Memorial with a Geometric Graphics on a Ceramic Plaque, Pet’s Name and Quote",
  "description": "Summary:\n- Handmade wooden urn for pet ashes, solid and durable, personalized with engraved quote, pet&#39;s name and dates of birth and death.\n- CUSTOMIZATION: send us details including your pet’s name and dates of birth and death, so we can personalize your urn. Sentence on the wooden paw can also be changed.\n- Urn&#39;s volume is 9,5 litres (600 cubic inches), suitable for pets up to 95 kilograms (210 pounds). The outside dimensions are: 21 x 29 x 22 cm (8.3 x 11.4 x 8.7 inches).\n- Removable lid and brass handles make the urn convenient to use. Wreath decorations and classic urn style make it timeless.\n- The lid is not seal. It has to be glued with any all purpose glue to keep it tight.\n- Detailed graphics on the ceramic tombstone plaque is applied by a sublimation method. It is resistant to fading or scratches.\n- All of our items are shipped with courier, so we can be sure that the order reaches you in the shortest possible time!\n\nPERSONALIZED URNS COLLECTION with CERAMIC PLAQUE\n\nWhen the saddest day comes we know that there is nothing that can ease your pain. We are here to help you to say the last goodbye to your precious dog.\nWe offer a collection of 100 urns with different dog breeds with geometric graphics. Give us your dog&#39;s name, date of birth and death and we will engrave them and make your own, personal memorial.\nWooden urn is made of birch, which makes it durable and lasting. The urn has brass handles and wreath shaped decorations. Engraving is applied to birch plywood. Its classic style makes it ageless.\nThis custom made urn will make your pet feel your love forever.",
